      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THUMANI (2) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 27.75 beating Hell Bent. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from four starts. Can make it back-to-back wins. GRAPEFRUIT SILLY (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (28.07) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Better than last start and can bounce back. SOLID AXLE (8) sailed across from an outside draw last start to score an all-the-way win (27.64) at this track in a Novice race over 488m. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to his credit. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. DODGY BEAR (7) was below best last time at Cannington (30.77) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 7 length seventh. Has an unbeaten record from this draw, scoring two times.",
